<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Country Rd yr net profit falls 36 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Country Rd yr net profit falls 36 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to July 28</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    16.41 vs 16.34</p>
<p>    Net				     10.17 vs 15.89</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	     4.0  vs 7.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Country Road Ltd is an up-market clothing retailer.  </p>
<p>    Sales				 278.19 vs 261.43</p>
